| Parameter | Details |
|---|---|
| Case ID | SIM-SC-001 |
| Patient Age | 45 years |
| Sex | Female |
| Suspected Drug | Metformin |
| Indication | Type 2 diabetes mellitus |
| Adverse Event | Nausea |
| Outcome | Recovered |
| Hospitalization | No |

## Classification

| Parameter | Classification |
|---|---|
| Severity | Mild |
| Seriousness | Non-serious |
| Expectedness | Expected* |
| Clinical Impact | Low |

### Rationale

The patient experienced nausea without hospitalization, life-threatening consequences, disability, or other serious outcome criteria. The event resolved and therefore does not meet the specified seriousness criteria.

\*Expectedness should ultimately be determined using the applicable reference safety information for the product and region.

